[19.06045, "o", "1. The assassin?! -> StrangerFamous\r\n2. What are you doing here? -> StrangerPurpose\r\n3. I've never heard of you. -> StrangerOffended\r\n\r\n[StrangerFamous]\r\nStranger: Former. Retired. Mostly. -> StrangerGreet\r\n\r\n[StrangerPurpose]\r\nStranger: Waiting. For someone like you, perhaps. -> StrangerGreet\r\n\r\n[StrangerOffended]\r\nStranger: Good. That means I did my job well. -> StrangerGreet\r\n\r\n[WorkOffer]\r\nStranger: Work? I have a task. Dangerous. Well-paid. Interested? -> WorkChoice\r\n\r\n[WorkChoice]\r\n1. What's the job? -> WorkDetails\r\n2. How dangerous? -> WorkRisk\r\n3. How much? -> WorkPay\r\n\r\n[WorkDetails]\r\nStranger: Retrieve an item from the old crypt. A ring. Don't ask what it does. -> WorkAccept\r\n\r\n[WorkRisk]\r\nStranger: Undead. Traps. The usual. -> WorkDetails\r\n\r\n[WorkPay]\r\nStranger: 100 gold on completion. More if you're fast. -> WorkAccept\r\n\r\n[WorkAccept]\r\n1. I'll do it. -> SideQuestAccepted\r\n2. I need more information. -> WorkDetails\r\n3. I have other priorities. -> StrangerGreet\r\n\r\n[SideQuestAccepted]\r\nStranger: Good"]
[19.060466, "o", ". Come back when it's done. Don't die. -> TavernChoice\r\n\r\n[BarFight]\r\nNarrator: Tables overturn! The tavern erupts into chaos! -> BarFightChoice\r\n\r\n[BarFightChoice]\r\n1. [Fight] Join the brawl! -> BarFightWin\r\n2. [Flee] Slip out the back! -> TavernExit\r\n3. [Hide] Duck under a table! -> BarFightHide\r\n\r\n[BarFightWin]\r\nNarrator: Fists fly. You emerge victorious, bruised but alive. -> BarFightAfter\r\n\r\n[BarFightHide]\r\nNarrator: Chaos swirls above as you wait it out. Eventually, calm returns. -> BarFightAfter\r\n\r\n[BarFightAfter]\r\nBarkeep: OUT! All of you! I'm closing early! -> TavernExit\r\n\r\n[TavernExit]\r\nNarrator: The cool night air greets you. The adventure continues... elsewhere. -> End\r\n\r\n[JourneyBegin]\r\nNarrator: The mountain looms in the distance. Your destiny awaits. -> End\r\n"]
[19.060621, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@f7655c49d8af:/app# "]
[93.64528, "i", "cat > /app/solution.py <<'PYCODE'\nimport re\nimport json\nfrom typing import Dict, List\n\n\ndef parse_script(text: str):\n    lines = text.splitlines()\n    nodes: List[Dict] = []\n    edges: List[Dict] = []\n\n    current_id = None\n    content: List[str] = []\n\n    def flush():\n        nonlocal current_id, content\n        if current_id is None:\n            return\n        # filter non-empty lines\n        content_lines = [l for l in content if l.strip() != \"\"]\n        if not content_lines:\n            # create empty node\n            nodes.append({\"id\": current_id, \"text\": \"\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"type\": \"line\"})\n            return\n        first = content_lines[0].lstrip()\n        if re.match(r'^\\d+\\.', first):\n            # choice node\n            nodes.append({\"id\": current_id, \"text\": \"\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"type\": \"choice\"})\n            for line in content_lines:\n                line = line.strip()\n                m = re.match(r'^\\d+\\.\\s*(.*)$', line)\n                option_text = m.group(1) if m else line\n                # s"]
[93.64533, "i", "plit on last arrow\n                if \"->\" in option_text:\n                    opt_text, target = option_text.rsplit(\"->\", 1)\n                    opt_text = opt_text.strip()\n                    target = target.strip()\n                else:\n                    opt_text = option_text.strip()\n                    target = None\n                if target:\n                    edges.append({\"from\": current_id, \"to\": target, \"text\": opt_text})\n        else:\n            # line node\n            line_text = \" \".join([l.strip() for l in content_lines])\n            if \"->\" in line_text:\n                before, target = line_text.rsplit(\"->\", 1)\n                target = target.strip()\n            else:\n                before = line_text\n                target = None\n            if \":\" in before:\n                speaker, text = before.split(\":\", 1)\n                speaker = speaker.strip()\n                text = text.strip()\n            else:\n                speaker = \"\"\n                text = before.strip()\n            node"]
[93.645452, "i", "s.append({\"id\": current_id, \"text\": text, \"speaker\": speaker, \"type\": \"line\"})\n            if target:\n                edges.append({\"from\": current_id, \"to\": target, \"text\": \"\"})\n\n    for raw in lines:\n        line = raw.strip()\n        if line.startswith(\"[\") and line.endswith(\"]\"):\n            flush()\n            current_id = line[1:-1].strip()\n            content = []\n        else:\n            content.append(raw)\n    flush()\n\n    # add implicit nodes for missing targets (e.g., End)\n    node_ids = {n[\"id\"] for n in nodes}\n    for e in edges:\n        if e[\"to\"] not in node_ids:\n            nodes.append({\"id\": e[\"to\"], \"text\": \"\", \"speaker\": \"\", \"type\": \"line\"})\n            node_ids.add(e[\"to\"])\n\n    return {\"nodes\": nodes, \"edges\": edges}\n\n\ndef to_dot(graph: Dict) -> str:\n    lines = [\"digraph Dialogue {\", \"  rankdir=LR;\", \"  node [shape=box];\"]\n    for node in graph[\"nodes\"]:\n        nid = node[\"id\"]\n        ntype = node.get(\"type\", \"\")\n        label = nid\n        if ntype == \"line\":\n            speaker = n"]
[93.645469, "o", "cat > /app/solution.py <<'PYCODE'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[93.645519, "i", "ode.get(\"speaker\", \"\")\n            text = node.get(\"text\", \"\")\n            if speaker:\n                label = f\"{nid}\\\\n{speaker}: {text}\"\n            else:\n                label = f\"{nid}\\\\n{text}\"\n        else:\n            label = f\"{nid}\\\\n(choice)\"\n        shape = \"diamond\" if ntype == \"choice\" else \"box\"\n        lines.append(f\"  \\\"{nid}\\\" [label=\\\"{label}\\\", shape={shape}];\")\n    for edge in graph[\"edges\"]:\n        frm = edge[\"from\"]\n        to = edge[\"to\"]\n        text = edge.get(\"text\", \"\")\n        if text:\n            lines.append(f\"  \\\"{frm}\\\" -> \\\"{to}\\\" [label=\\\"{text}\\\"]; \")\n        else:\n            lines.append(f\"  \\\"{frm}\\\" -> \\\"{to}\\\";\")\n    lines.append(\"}\")\n    return \"\\n\".join(lines)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    with open(\"/app/script.txt\", \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        text = f.read()\n    graph = parse_script(text)\n    with open(\"/app/dialogue.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(graph, f, indent=2)\n    dot = to_dot(graph)\n    with open(\"/app/dialogue.dot\", \"w\""]
[93.645544, "o", "import re\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> import json\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[93.645566, "i", ", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(dot)\nPYCODE\n"]
